# The Dockerfile builds Rust workspace binaries; browser assets live in adapters/management/ui.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!bins/
!bins/**
!crates/
!crates/**
!adapters/
!adapters/**
!tests/
!tests/**

# The root * excludes Cargo's top-level target/; keep source directories named target.
# Exclude generated assets and local secrets inside the allowed workspace trees.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
